  <!-- Column 2 Text -->
  <div slot="col-2-text">
    <p>
      Hopes and dreams can be fulfilled,<br>
      Just don’t give up the fight;<br>
      But carry on and do your Best,<br>
      They’ll come when time is right .<br>
      Trials and struggles are not in vain,<br>
      Though sometimes the journey’s hard;<br>
      Make the effort you won’t fail,<br>
      You will get your just reward .<br>
      Don’t look for it tomorrow though;<br>
      Next week? Next month? Next year?<br>
      Have patience. One day it will come<br>
      To fill your heart with cheer.<br>
      A good job done is never wasted,<br>
      Whether it be large or small;<br>
      It can hold countless blessings,<br>
      Bringing great benefit to all.<br>
      Always Give of your Best<br>
      By Eila Webster
    </p>
  </div>

